<title>DENMARK: Danish April wholesale prices up 1.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish April wholesale prices up 1.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices rose by 0.9 percent in April 1997 from March 1997 and were up 1.6 percent from April 1996, the national statistics office said on</p>
<p>Monday.</p>
<p>					April 1997  March 1997  April 1996</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    +0.9	  +0.1	+0.4</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +1.6	  +1.2	+1.1</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)   105.9	105.0     104.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. Analysts had forecast an average 1.1 percent yr/yr WPI rise for April and a 0.3 percent rise on the month. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
